# Source documents the app is built against, not part of it. The August 2026
# feed formulations govern every concentrate and TMR BOM here — see
# demo/build_concentrates.py and demo/build_feed_rations.py, which carry the
# figures in code — but the workbooks themselves are revised on the farm and
# do not diff, so they are kept out of the history rather than versioned in it.
